+  | `lot-tracker/out.json` | `/lot-tracker/`**`lot-tracker/out.json`** — next to the page |
+  | `out.json` | `/lot-tracker/out.json` — next to the page |
+  | `/tmp/out.json` | `/tmp/out.json` **in the item**, not the sandbox's `/tmp` |
